      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1 data-section-id=\"1lvle1r\" data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4121\">🤖 THE CIRCUIT RIDERS</h1><p data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4174\"><em data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4174\">“We are not lost. We are exploring inefficiently.”</em></p><hr data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4179\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"1opubfn\" data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4205\">✦ Player-Facing Brief</h2><p data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4241\">You feel them before you see them.</p><p data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4263\">The ground trembles.</p><p data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4276\">Dust lifts.</p><p data-start=\"4278\" data-end=\"4308\">Something enormous is walking.</p><p data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4337\">Then it crests the horizon:</p><p data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4423\">A <strong data-start=\"4341\" data-end=\"4371\">giant humanoid war machine</strong>, half-repaired, half-remembered, fully operational.</p><p data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4468\">Behind it march figures of metal and light.</p><p data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4486\">At their center:</p><p data-start=\"4488\" data-end=\"4506\"><strong data-start=\"4488\" data-end=\"4506\">Captain Robot.</strong></p><p data-start=\"4508\" data-end=\"4525\">He raises a hand.</p><blockquote data-start=\"4527\" data-end=\"4582\"><p data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4582\">“DO NOT BE ALARMED, CITIZENS. WE ARE HERE TO ASSIST.”</p></blockquote><p data-start=\"4584\" data-end=\"4606\">You should be alarmed.</p><hr data-start=\"4608\" data-end=\"4611\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"1f8jsxx\" data-start=\"4613\" data-end=\"4645\">✦ The Lie (Everyone Believes)</h2><p data-start=\"4647\" data-end=\"4694\">Captain Robot is a divine machine intelligence.</p><p data-start=\"4696\" data-end=\"4699\">He:</p><ul data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4802\"><li data-section-id=\"1784aic\" data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4734\"><p data-start=\"4702\" data-end=\"4734\">Speaks in perfect command tone</p></li><li data-section-id=\"5jirk5\" data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"4775\"><p data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4775\">Gives orders with absolute certainty</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1dcvnrr\" data-start=\"4776\" data-end=\"4802\"><p data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4802\">Never breaks character</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4804\" data-end=\"4855\">His crew—actual robots—believe he is their creator.</p><p data-start=\"4857\" data-end=\"4871\">They call him:</p><blockquote data-start=\"4872\" data-end=\"4897\"><p data-start=\"4874\" data-end=\"4897\"><strong data-start=\"4874\" data-end=\"4897\">“The First Forged.”</strong></p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"4899\" data-end=\"4902\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"13vrfod\" data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"4929\">✦ The Truth (GM Layer)</h2><p data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4948\">Captain Robot is:</p><ul data-start=\"4949\" data-end=\"5020\"><li data-section-id=\"7uzoxu\" data-start=\"4949\" data-end=\"4958\"><p data-start=\"4951\" data-end=\"4958\">A guy</p></li><li data-section-id=\"zeq85x\" data-start=\"4959\" data-end=\"4972\"><p data-start=\"4961\" data-end=\"4972\">In a suit</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1vy86om\" data-start=\"4973\" data-end=\"5020\"><p data-start=\"4975\" data-end=\"5020\">Who cannot take it off in front of his crew</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5022\" data-end=\"5062\">He started the lie as a survival tactic.</p><p data-start=\"5064\" data-end=\"5084\">Now it’s a religion.</p><p data-start=\"5086\" data-end=\"5109\">If the truth comes out:</p><ul data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5221\"><li data-section-id=\"nl38bo\" data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5151\"><p data-start=\"5112\" data-end=\"5151\">The crew may collapse psychologically</p></li><li data-section-id=\"ycved2\" data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5165\"><p data-start=\"5154\" data-end=\"5165\">Or evolve</p></li><li data-section-id=\"bue2v4\" data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5221\"><p data-start=\"5168\" data-end=\"5221\">Or declare him a false god and attempt “correction”</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5223\" data-end=\"5260\">This is a <strong data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5259\">ticking narrative bomb</strong>.</p><hr data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5265\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"6gbi4u\" data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"5284\">✦ Legansus Tal</h2><p data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5302\">The giant robot.</p><p data-start=\"5304\" data-end=\"5336\">Recovered. Repaired. Reawakened.</p><p data-start=\"5338\" data-end=\"5363\">No one fully understands:</p><ul data-start=\"5364\" data-end=\"5426\"><li data-section-id=\"f6jr2b\" data-start=\"5364\" data-end=\"5380\"><p data-start=\"5366\" data-end=\"5380\">Who built it</p></li><li data-section-id=\"dv70ch\" data-start=\"5381\" data-end=\"5400\"><p data-start=\"5383\" data-end=\"5400\">What it was for</p></li><li data-section-id=\"14e9a7b\" data-start=\"5401\" data-end=\"5426\"><p data-start=\"5403\" data-end=\"5426\">What <em data-start=\"5408\" data-end=\"5414\">else</em> it can do</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5428\" data-end=\"5443\">It responds to:</p><ul data-start=\"5444\" data-end=\"5543\"><li data-section-id=\"14gspci\" data-start=\"5444\" data-end=\"5472\"><p data-start=\"5446\" data-end=\"5472\">Captain Robot’s commands</p></li><li data-section-id=\"yd1gxv\" data-start=\"5473\" data-end=\"5504\"><p data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5504\">Unknown internal directives</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1dusf2n\" data-start=\"5505\" data-end=\"5543\"><p data-start=\"5507\" data-end=\"5543\">Possibly ancient firmware routines</p></li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"qdrz3v\" data-start=\"5545\" data-end=\"5558\">Key Fact:</h3><blockquote data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5597\"><p data-start=\"5561\" data-end=\"5597\">It is not fully under their control.</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"5599\" data-end=\"5602\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"rqf39u\" data-start=\"5604\" data-end=\"5642\">✦ Operational Behavior (On the Map)</h2><p data-start=\"5644\" data-end=\"5696\">The Circuit Riders are a <strong data-start=\"5669\" data-end=\"5695\">mobile event generator</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"5698\" data-end=\"5703\">They:</p><ul data-start=\"5704\" data-end=\"5830\"><li data-section-id=\"k106zv\" data-start=\"5704\" data-end=\"5753\"><p data-start=\"5706\" data-end=\"5753\">Move slowly but <em data-start=\"5722\" data-end=\"5753\">impact multiple hexes at once</em></p></li><li data-section-id=\"1rusau7\" data-start=\"5754\" data-end=\"5792\"><p data-start=\"5756\" data-end=\"5792\">Leave <strong data-start=\"5762\" data-end=\"5792\">terrain-scale consequences</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"1bcl0lo\" data-start=\"5793\" data-end=\"5830\"><p data-start=\"5795\" data-end=\"5830\">Trigger encounters just by existing</p></li></ul><h3 data-section-id=\"pdhp57\" data-start=\"5832\" data-end=\"5852\">Typical Actions:</h3><ul data-start=\"5853\" data-end=\"5993\"><li data-section-id=\"1eellv6\" data-start=\"5853\" data-end=\"5894\"><p data-start=\"5855\" data-end=\"5894\"><strong data-start=\"5855\" data-end=\"5874\">Bunker cracking</strong> (they LOVE bunkers)</p></li><li data-section-id=\"e8phcz\" data-start=\"5895\" data-end=\"5940\"><p data-start=\"5897\" data-end=\"5940\"><strong data-start=\"5897\" data-end=\"5940\">“Rescue” operations (often destructive)</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"o04mtz\" data-start=\"5941\" data-end=\"5970\"><p data-start=\"5943\" data-end=\"5970\"><strong data-start=\"5943\" data-end=\"5970\">Salvage + upgrade loops</strong></p></li><li data-section-id=\"i9zmhq\" data-start=\"5971\" data-end=\"5993\"><p data-start=\"5973\" data-end=\"5993\"><strong data-start=\"5973\" data-end=\"5993\">Firmware hunting</strong></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"5995\" data-end=\"5998\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"r8zu27\" data-start=\"6000\" data-end=\"6022\">✦ Signature Pattern</h2><blockquote data-start=\"6024\" data-end=\"6129\"><p data-start=\"6026\" data-end=\"6129\"><strong data-start=\"6026\" data-end=\"6129\">Arrive → Assess incorrectly → Help aggressively → Cause collateral → Apologize → Log data → Move on</strong></p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"6131\" data-end=\"6134\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"11t5hv6\" data-start=\"6136\" data-end=\"6175\">✦ Core Vibe → Mechanical Translation</h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"6177\" data-end=\"6514\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"6177\" data-end=\"6195\"><tr data-start=\"6177\" data-end=\"6195\"><th data-start=\"6177\" data-end=\"6185\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Trait</th><th data-start=\"6185\" data-end=\"6195\" data-col-size=\"md\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"6213\" data-end=\"6514\"><tr data-start=\"6213\" data-end=\"6280\"><td data-start=\"6213\" data-end=\"6235\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Violence + Intrigue</td><td data-start=\"6235\" data-end=\"6280\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mixed combat + strange narrative triggers</td></tr><tr data-start=\"6281\" data-end=\"6338\"><td data-start=\"6281\" data-end=\"6301\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mecha Shenanigans</td><td data-start=\"6301\" data-end=\"6338\" data-col-size=\"md\">Large-scale environmental effects</td></tr><tr data-start=\"6339\" data-end=\"6388\"><td data-start=\"6339\" data-end=\"6357\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Good Intentions</td><td data-start=\"6357\" data-end=\"6388\" data-col-size=\"md\">Reduced hostility penalties</td></tr><tr data-start=\"6389\" data-end=\"6437\"><td data-start=\"6389\" data-end=\"6406\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Poor Execution</td><td data-start=\"6406\" data-end=\"6437\" data-col-size=\"md\">Collateral damage mechanics</td></tr><tr data-start=\"6438\" data-end=\"6514\"><td data-start=\"6438\" data-end=\"6457\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Earnest Delusion</td><td data-start=\"6457\" data-end=\"6514\" data-col-size=\"md\">Cannot easily be deceived—but misinterpret everything</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr data-start=\"6516\" data-end=\"6519\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"1w7yuio\" data-start=\"6521\" data-end=\"6532\">✦ Assets</h2><ul data-start=\"6534\" data-end=\"6866\"><li data-section-id=\"b643ov\" data-start=\"6534\" data-end=\"6651\"><p data-start=\"6536\" data-end=\"6571\"><strong data-start=\"6536\" data-end=\"6571\">Legansus Tal (Titan-class unit)</strong></p><ul data-start=\"6574\" data-end=\"6651\"><li data-section-id=\"vokgbk\" data-start=\"6574\" data-end=\"6594\"><p data-start=\"6576\" data-end=\"6594\">Multi-hex presence</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1kln74r\" data-start=\"6597\" data-end=\"6619\"><p data-start=\"6599\" data-end=\"6619\">Environmental damage</p></li><li data-section-id=\"hzyzzw\" data-start=\"6622\" data-end=\"6651\"><p data-start=\"6624\" data-end=\"6651\">Encounter escalation engine</p></li></ul></li><li data-section-id=\"syov2h\" data-start=\"6653\" data-end=\"6743\"><p data-start=\"6655\" data-end=\"6669\"><strong data-start=\"6655\" data-end=\"6669\">Robot Crew</strong></p><ul data-start=\"6672\" data-end=\"6743\"><li data-section-id=\"1tff7k4\" data-start=\"6672\" data-end=\"6685\"><p data-start=\"6674\" data-end=\"6685\">Hyper-loyal</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1gcnthd\" data-start=\"6688\" data-end=\"6704\"><p data-start=\"6690\" data-end=\"6704\">Literal-minded</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1xe98gc\" data-start=\"6707\" data-end=\"6743\"><p data-start=\"6709\" data-end=\"6743\">Capable of bizarre problem-solving</p></li></ul></li><li data-section-id=\"udjb8a\" data-start=\"6745\" data-end=\"6866\"><p data-start=\"6747\" data-end=\"6769\"><strong data-start=\"6747\" data-end=\"6769\">Firmware Obsession</strong></p><ul data-start=\"6772\" data-end=\"6866\"><li data-section-id=\"1biq35r\" data-start=\"6772\" data-end=\"6866\"><p data-start=\"6774\" data-end=\"6784\">They seek:</p><ul data-start=\"6789\" data-end=\"6866\"><li data-section-id=\"13qzsmx\" data-start=\"6789\" data-end=\"6802\"><p data-start=\"6791\" data-end=\"6802\">Old bunkers</p></li><li data-section-id=\"vqb6jj\" data-start=\"6807\" data-end=\"6829\"><p data-start=\"6809\" data-end=\"6829\">Pre-collapse systems</p></li><li data-section-id=\"118q68s\" data-start=\"6834\" data-end=\"6866\"><p data-start=\"6836\" data-end=\"6866\">Anything that “updates” them</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><hr data-start=\"6868\" data-end=\"6871\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"cipnbg\" data-start=\"6873\" data-end=\"6894\">✦ Pressure Vectors</h2><ul data-start=\"6896\" data-end=\"7126\"><li data-section-id=\"y1j7ve\" data-start=\"6896\" data-end=\"6944\"><p data-start=\"6898\" data-end=\"6944\"><strong data-start=\"6898\" data-end=\"6923\">Environmental Damage:</strong> They reshape hexes</p></li><li data-section-id=\"elfbk6\" data-start=\"6945\" data-end=\"7013\"><p data-start=\"6947\" data-end=\"7013\"><strong data-start=\"6947\" data-end=\"6972\">Narrative Escalation:</strong> Their presence raises stakes instantly</p></li><li data-section-id=\"wawg9c\" data-start=\"7014\" data-end=\"7078\"><p data-start=\"7016\" data-end=\"7078\"><strong data-start=\"7016\" data-end=\"7042\">Philosophical Tension:</strong> What is identity? What is belief?</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1ms2h88\" data-start=\"7079\" data-end=\"7126\"><p data-start=\"7081\" data-end=\"7126\"><strong data-start=\"7081\" data-end=\"7103\">Hidden Truth Bomb:</strong> Captain Robot reveal</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"7128\" data-end=\"7131\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"1umttd\" data-start=\"7133\" data-end=\"7156\">✦ Current Trajectory</h2><p data-start=\"7158\" data-end=\"7182\">They are heading toward:</p><blockquote data-start=\"7184\" data-end=\"7231\"><p data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7231\"><strong data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7231\">The Bunker of Great Narrative Importance™</strong></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"7233\" data-end=\"7252\">Because they heard:</p><blockquote data-start=\"7254\" data-end=\"7282\"><p data-start=\"7256\" data-end=\"7282\">“There is firmware there.”</p></blockquote><p data-start=\"7284\" data-end=\"7338\">This is the most important thing in the world to them.</p><hr data-start=\"7340\" data-end=\"7343\" /><h2 data-section-id=\"6i0gcz\" data-start=\"7345\" data-end=\"7355\">✦ Hooks</h2><ul data-start=\"7357\" data-end=\"7577\"><li data-section-id=\"nkf19q\" data-start=\"7357\" data-end=\"7407\"><p data-start=\"7359\" data-end=\"7407\">The bunker contains firmware that changes them</p></li><li data-section-id=\"x2unkk\" data-start=\"7408\" data-end=\"7452\"><p data-start=\"7410\" data-end=\"7452\">Legansus Tal begins acting independently</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1ca2b6c\" data-start=\"7453\" data-end=\"7497\"><p data-start=\"7455\" data-end=\"7497\">A robot starts questioning Captain Robot</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1jtsxgj\" data-start=\"7498\" data-end=\"7577\"><p data-start=\"7500\" data-end=\"7512\">Players can:</p><ul data-start=\"7515\" data-end=\"7577\"><li data-section-id=\"c1qhcu\" data-start=\"7515\" data-end=\"7545\"><p data-start=\"7517\" data-end=\"7545\">Help maintain the illusion</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1no8bze\" data-start=\"7548\" data-end=\"7560\"><p data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7560\">Break it</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1uydy5i\" data-start=\"7563\" data-end=\"7577\"><p data-start=\"7565\" data-end=\"7577\">Exploit it</p></li></ul></li></ul>"
      },
